OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy but mostly dry
OL,6,Fmorning. Scattered showers developing
OL,7,Fthrough the afternoon, these may turn
OL,8,Fheavy with the risk of hail and
OL,9,Fthunder. Light westerly winds
OL,10,Ffreshening as the showers move through.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FSome showers quickly moving
OL,13,Faway eastwards this evening. Turning
OL,14,Fdrier and clearer overnight, though
OL,15,Fperhaps the odd shower returning from
OL,16,Fthe west by dawn. A relatively cool
OL,17,Fnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
